name: trade_over_invoicing
description: "Over-invoicing - exporters and importers that traded at more than 3 times the month's reference price (max_x_reference and the trade ids in via), with their directors. Look for a pair whose two companies share a director and whose prices of one HS code jump between 3 and 8 times the reference. A specialty supplier priced at a steady 3.3 to 3.9 times the reference, to many unrelated buyers with their own directors, is the honest pattern to compare."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: trade_over_invoicing_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[4]: ts,amount,via,flag
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
